<tr style="height: 40px;">
<td style="height: 40px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Action Required</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 71px;">
<td style="height: 71px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">This notice is to inform you that a profile has been created for you by an Intel</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Account Representative so you may participate in the</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com/login?so=00Do0000000aRcf" style="color: #086db6;">Intel Co-Marketing Portal</a></span><span> </span><span style="color: #666666;">for your company,</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">With the log in information below you can access the web portal at:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #086db6;"><a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com/login?so=00Do0000000aRcf" style="color: #086db6;">https://partnercenter.intel.com</a>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">Please retain this e-mail for future reference.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 53px;">
<td style="height: 53px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Email ID:</strong>  {!Contact.Email}</span><br><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>Intel Business Account Name:</strong> <span>{!Account.Name}</span></span><br><br></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 53px;">
<td style="height: 53px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;"><strong>What you need to do:</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Complete your set up by clicking this</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://intel--crmqa3.sandbox.my.site.com/Partnercenter" style="color: #086db6;">link</a> </span><span style="color: #666666;">or by copying the URL into your browser.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">If you feel you’ve received this e-mail in error, please contact</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://intelinside.intel.com/support" style="color: #086db6;">Intel Customer Support</a></span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #666666;">Thank you for your interest! Please follow this link to complete your set up.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Visit</span> <span style="color: #086db6;"><a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/my-intel/manage-profile.html" style="color: #086db6;">My Intel</a></span> <span style="color: #666666;">any time to manage your profile.</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 116.5px;">
<td style="height: 116.5px;">
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.</span>    </span><br><span style="font-size: 10pt; color: #666666;">To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book.</span></p>
</td>
